      <title>欣兴电子涉嫌改标中国PCB为台湾制造遭检方调查</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260831/%E6%AC%A3%E5%85%B4%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E6%B6%89%E5%AB%8C%E6%94%B9%E6%A0%87%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BDPCB%E4%B8%BA%E5%8F%B0%E6%B9%BE%E5%88%B6%E9%80%A0%E9%81%AD%E6%A3%80%E6%96%B9%E8%B0%83%E6%9F%A5/</link>
